`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"},"852":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-18","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"853":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-19","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"854":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-20","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#default","content":"Minimal usage with a `Label`, min/max, and stepper `Button`s."},"855":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-21","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"856":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` for validation feedback."},"857":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."},"858":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#hide-stepper","content":"Compose without stepper `Button`s for a plain numeric input."},"859":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#value-scale","content":"Use `minValue`, `maxValue`, and `step` to set the allowed val