"id":"/docs/components/select-19","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/components/select-20","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/components/select-21","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/components/select-22","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/components/select-23","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/components/select-24","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/components/select-25","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#default","content":"Minimal usage with a `Label`, items, and a placeholder."},"1212":{"id":"/docs/components/select-26","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"1213":{"id":"/docs/components/select-27","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#multiple","content":"Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values. `value` is an array of keys."},"1214":{"id":"/docs/components/select-28","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` for validation feedback."},"1215":{"id":"/docs/components/select-29","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent interaction."},"1216":{"id":"/docs/components/select-30","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#form","content":"Set `name` to submit the value with a native `<form>`. Multiple-mode values submit as repeated entries with the same `name`."},"1217":{"id":"/docs/components/select-31","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#sizes","content":"Compare the supported `md` and `sm` visual sizes."},"1218":{"id":"/docs/components/select-32","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#composed","content":"Write the trigger and the overlay yourself instead of composing `SelectOptions`, for full control\nover the popover and the list."},"1219":{"id":"/docs/components/structure","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"page","content":"Structure primitives","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-0","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"Generic structural containers for composing a component's interior."},"1221":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-1","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading