uilt on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."},"1232":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-12","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."},"1233":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-13","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1234":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-14","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1235":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-15","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`ButtonGroup`** — a cluster of related actions, typically inside a `Footer` (an end-aligned, wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`)."},"1236":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-16","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."},"1237":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-17","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"Each container works in two modes:"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-18","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."},"1239":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-19","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."},"1240":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-20","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#default","content":"The shared structural containers composed together into a card-like layout. Each is a\nplain semantic region here; inside a parent that provides their contexts (e.g. `Modal`)\nthey adopt that parent's spacing automatically."},"1241":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-21","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#group","content":"Group is the bordered field box. Size and invalid/disabled chrome apply here."},"1242":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-22","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#props","content":"`Content`, `Header`, `Footer`, and `ButtonGroup` each accept all `Flex` layout props."},"1243":{"id":"/docs/components/switch","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"page","content":"Switch","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-0","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch","content":"A binary toggle control that switches a setting between on and off states, communicated via the WAI-ARIA switch role."},"1245":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-1","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#features","content":"Features"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-2","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#installation","content":"Installation"},"1247":{"id":"/